+				<p class="offer-sub"><?php esc_html_e( 'All 3 career tracks: Data Scientist, Gen AI Developer and Agentic AI Engineer. Animated lessons, real projects, certificates.', 'vitalstack' ); ?></p>
+				<ul class="offer-tracks">
